Cell["\<\
A 3-array has no flat picture of its own, so it is drawn as a row of \
matrices, the first index choosing the matrix:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"8c572367-d80a-2e44-9e96-c02f99494d13"],

Cell["ArrayGraphics[Array[#1 + #2 + #3 &, {2, 2, 2}]]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"663571c2-fb56-7545-896c-c815ced88f72"],

